    "message": "GenomeInfoDb 1.49.3: getChromInfoFromEnsembl() queries the old Ensembl FTP\n\nFollowing the total revamp of the Ensembl website and FTP servers that\noccurred in Summer 2026, getChromInfoFromEnsembl() now queries the old\n(legacy) Ensembl FTP sites that got moved to the EMBL-EBI FTP server.\nThis is temporary until getChromInfoFromEnsembl() gets refactored to\nquery the new live Ensembl website.\n",
    "time": 1794862808
